    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d262-a2">

                <pb facs="0415" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg327"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Lord Stanley, of Preston.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Newport</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-08-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 25,
                    1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to my telegram of
                    to-day, I have the honor to inclose copy of a note which I have received from
                    the United States Government, in reply to my note of the 20th instant on the
                    canal toll question, setting forth the reasons which have compelled the
                    President to issue the retaliatory proclamation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Michael H.
                    Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
